The quorum of the general assembly is one third of the members present, as stated in the amendment adopted on 2 May 2026[[cite:obs-0fea77438fbfe3945c0fd4e4af8f4005c2b0c0b2 "Section Quorum is amended: the general assembly has a quorum when one third of the members are present."]]. Where the amendment of 2 May 2026 and the bylaws differ, the amendment applies[[cite:obs-0fea77438fbfe3945c0fd4e4af8f4005c2b0c0b2 "Section Quorum is amended: the general assembly has a quorum when one third of the members are present."]].
